ent-MobPaperwork = 文書工作 | Paperwork
    .desc = 從第13號太空站調職後，他開始在圖書館從事整理書籍的新工作。看來他做這份工作時，速度依然很慢。 | Took up a new job sorting books in the library after he got transferred from Space Station 13. He seems to be just as slow at this.
    .suffix = { ent-MobSloth.suffix }
ent-MobWalter = 華特 | Walter
    .desc = 他喜歡化學品和零食。華特。 | He likes chems and treats. Walter.
    .suffix = { ent-SimpleMobBase.suffix }
ent-MobPossumMorty = 莫蒂 | Morty
    .desc = 該站常駐的美國袋鼯。牠是個敏感但韌性十足的小傢伙。 | The station's resident Didelphis virginiana. A sensitive but resilient kind of guy.
    .suffix = { ent-MobPossum.suffix }
ent-MobPossumMortyOld = 莫蒂 | Morty
    .desc = { ent-MobPossumMorty.desc }
    .suffix = Old sprite
ent-MobPossumPoppy = 罌粟
