    .suffix = { ent-MobPossumMorty.suffix }
ent-MobRaccoonMorticia = 莫蒂西亞 | Morticia
    .desc = 一位強大的夜之生物。她的眼影總是畫得恰到好處。 | A powerful creature of the night. Her eyeshadow is always on point.
